{"speciesId":226,"names":{"fr":"Démanta","es":"Mantine","en":"Mantine","ja":"マンタイン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn't care if REMORAID attach to it for scavenging its leftovers."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It swims along freely, eating things that swim into its mouth. Its whole body is very coarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the waves. It is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if REMORAID attach to it to scavenge for its leftovers."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When the waves are calm, one may encounter a swarm of MANTINE swimming as if they are in flight."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It swims elegantly, mindless of REMORAID hitching on to its broad fins. It has a docile nature."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores REMORAID that cling to its fins seeking food scraps."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if REMORAID attach to it for scavenging its leftovers."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ignore royalement les Rémoraid qui s’accrochent à ses nageoires pour manger les restes qu’il sème."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ignore royalement les Rémoraid qui s’accrochent à ses nageoires pour manger les restes qu’il sème."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can fly over 300 feet out of the water from the surface of the ocean."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can fly over 300 feet out of the water from the surface of the ocean."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut planer au-dessus des vagues sur plus de 100 m en prenant son élan dans la mer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Acumula velocidad nadando y puede saltar fuera del agua, alcanzando 100 metros de altura, para descender luego planeando."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can fly over 300 feet out of the water from the surface of the ocean."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"泳いで スピードが のってくると 波の上に 飛びだし そのまま １００メートルも 滑空 する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il ignore royalement les Rémoraid qui s’accrochent à ses nageoires pour manger les restes qu’il sème."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Nada con gran elegancia e ignora a los Remoraid que se aferran a sus aletas buscando restos de comida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"悠然と 海を 泳ぐうちに 食べ残しを ねらった テッポウオが ヒレに くっつくが 気にしていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les jours de beau temps, on peut voir des bancs de Démanta sauter au-dessus des vagues. Le Rémoraid qui l’accompagne ne dérange pas ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En los días que hace sol, es posible ver bancos de Mantine saltando con elegancia por entre las olas del mar. A estos Pokémon no les molestan los Remoraid que se les pegan."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On sunny days, schools of Mantine can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This Pokémon is not bothered by the Remoraid that hitches rides."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"晴れた 日には 海の 上を 優雅に 跳ねる マンタインの 群れを 見ることが できるよ。 テッポウオが くっついていても 気にしない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les jours de beau temps, on peut voir des bancs de Démanta sauter au-dessus des vagues. Le Rémoraid qui l’accompagne ne dérange pas ce Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En los días que hace sol, es posible ver bancos de Mantine saltando con elegancia por entre las olas del mar. A estos Pokémon no les molestan los Remoraid que se les pegan."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On sunny days, schools of Mantine can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This Pokémon is not bothered by the Remoraid that hitches rides."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"晴れた 日には 海の 上を 優雅に 跳ねる マンタインの 群れを 見ることが できるよ。 テッポウオが くっついていても 気にしない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Une carte postale ou un poster d’un Démanta planant gracieusement au-dessus des vagues est un souvenir typique d’Alola."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un souvenir típico de Alola son las postales y pósteres con dibujos de Mantine saltando grácilmente sobre las olas del mar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Postcards and posters featuring Mantine leaping elegantly above the waves are popular souvenirs of Alola."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"優雅に 波の 上を 飛びはねる マンタインを 描いた 絵ハガキや ポスターは 人気のアローラ土産。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Nombreux sont les surfeurs qui ont trouvé leur vocation après être tombés sous le charme de la nage majestueuse d’un Démanta."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Muchos surfistas se iniciaron en la disciplina inspirados por el grácil nado de los Mantine."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Many people have taken up surfing because they admire how magnificently Mantine swims."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"華麗に 泳ぐ マンタインに 憧れ サーフィンを 始めたと いう 人も 多いのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut planer au-dessus des vagues sur plus de 100 m en prenant son élan dans la mer."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Tras ganar velocidad nadando, aprovecha las olas para proyectarse y recorrer planeando hasta 100 m de distancia."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can jump out above the waves and glide for over 300 feet."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"泳いで スピードが のってくると 波の上に 飛びだし そのまま １００メートルも 滑空 する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il nage paisiblement, sans se soucier des Rémoraid qui s’agrippent à lui pour lui voler ses restes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Mientras nada plácidamente, no le importa que los Remoraid se aferren a él para comerse sus sobras."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if Remoraid attach to it to scavenge for its leftovers."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"悠然と 海を 泳ぐ。 食べ残しを 狙った テッポウオが くっついていても 気にしていない。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This calm and gentle Pokémon swims gracefully through the sea. After building speed, it can leap out of the water. It is often misidentified as a bird Pok